			title: "Welcome to the Abyssal Chasm"
			x: -16.0d
			y: -7.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Beyond the light of the prehistoric world lies the &8Forlorn Hollows&r, a desolate realm consumed by darkness and decay."
				""
				"Once a thriving ecosystem, these caverns have long since fallen into ruin. Towering stone pillars, endless chasms, and forests of twisted fungi now stretch across a landscape where little life remains. Strange creatures stalk the shadows, while an unsettling silence hangs over every forgotten corridor."
				""
				"Few who enter the Hollows ever leave unchanged."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Unlike the vibrant worlds you've explored before, the Forlorn Hollows reward patience and caution over brute force."
				""
				"Visibility is limited, dangerous creatures often emerge from the darkness without warning, and many of the planet's greatest treasures lie hidden within abandoned ruins and forgotten caverns. Keep your eyes open as you travel, for valuable resources and powerful relics are often concealed just beyond the reach of your torchlight."
				""
				"The darkness itself has become part of the landscape."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Despite its bleak appearance, the &8Forlorn Hollows&r hold some of the most valuable resources in Create: Forge Frontier."
				""
				"Explore ancient structures, uncover mysterious relics, gather rare materials such as &8Guanostone&r and &5Pure Darkness&r, and prepare to confront the powerful creatures that now rule this forgotten world. Many of these resources are essential for advanced crafting and will play a vital role in completing the &cTier 6 Rocket&r."
				""
				"The light may have abandoned these caverns long ago..."
				""
				"But your journey into the darkness has only just begun."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "alexscaves:peering_coprolith"
				tag: { }
			}
			id: "172EE8617C59F90A"
