		}
		{
			description: [
				"Hidden beneath layers of frosting, chocolate, and sugary stone lies the &dCandy Cavity&r, a whimsical world unlike any you've explored before."
				""
				"Towering candy cane forests, rivers of melted chocolate, mountains of cake, and fields of colorful sweets stretch across the landscape. At first glance this sugary paradise appears peaceful, but beneath its cheerful appearance lie dangerous creatures, mysterious machines, and ingredients unlike anything found elsewhere in the galaxy."
				""
				"Don't let its sweetness fool you."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Candy Cavity is home to countless culinary ingredients used throughout late-game progression. Chocolate, Honey Sprinkles, Rock Candy, Frosting, and many other confectionery resources harvested here become essential for crafting powerful foods used in the &6Culinary Life Support Matrix&r and other advanced recipes."
				""
				"Nearly every corner of this world offers something worth collecting."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Take your time exploring every hill, cave, and village."
				""
				"The greatest rewards of the Candy Cavity aren't always hidden inside chests—many are growing right out of the landscape itself."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "alexscaves:large_peppermint"
			id: "6B1D694ADAF367E0"
			shape: "gear"
			size: 3.0d
			tasks: [
				{
