			]
			title: "Welcome to the Candy Cavity"
			x: 18.5d
			y: 7.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Hidden deep beneath an ancient mountain range lies the &9Magnetic Caves&r, a subterranean world unlike any you've explored before."
				""
				"Immense magnetic crystals, floating islands of &8Galena&r, and the remnants of forgotten mining operations fill these caverns, each shaped by forces far beyond ordinary geology. Strange magnetic anomalies influence everything around them, turning even the landscape itself into part of the challenge."
				""
				"Every expedition into these caves is as much about understanding the environment as it is surviving it."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Magnetic Caves are among the richest sources of industrial materials found anywhere in Create: Forge Frontier."
				""
				"Powerful ores, rare minerals, and unique magnetic resources found here become essential for advanced metallurgy, Create machinery, and several late-game Forge Rocket components. Mastering these caverns will provide everything needed to complete the final stages of your factory."
				""
				"The age of exploration is coming to an end."
				""
				"The age of engineering begins here."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "alexscaves:telecore"
				tag: { }
			}
			id: "14077793D0743DF5"
