		}
		{
			description: [
				"Beyond the lush forests of the Primordial Caves lies a world forever changed by radiation, pollution, and unchecked scientific ambition."
				""
				"The &2Toxic Caves&r are a wasteland where glowing rivers wind through poisoned marshes, strange fungi thrive upon contaminated soil, and mutated creatures roam an ecosystem that should no longer exist. Every step deeper into these caverns reveals the scars left behind by an ancient catastrophe."
				""
				"Few worlds in the galaxy are as hostile—or as fascinating."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Despite their desolate appearance, the Toxic Caves contain an abundance of valuable chemical resources unavailable anywhere else in Create: Forge Frontier."
				""
				"Rare compounds, radioactive elements, and biological materials harvested throughout the biome form the foundation of advanced engineering projects, powerful protective equipment, and several Forge Rocket components."
				""
				"Every expedition into this wasteland yields discoveries capable of transforming your factory."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Surviving here requires preparation above all else."
				""
				"Powerful creatures, hazardous terrain, and radioactive materials await around every corner. Take your time, explore carefully, and never underestimate the dangers hidden beneath the glowing landscape."
				""
				"Only those willing to embrace the wasteland will uncover its greatest secrets."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "alexscaves:waste_drum"
