		{
			dependencies: ["308B363D1029D44E"]
			description: [
				"The &8Hullbreaker&r is one of the most feared predators within the &1Abyssal Chasm&r."
				""
				"These colossal creatures patrol the deepest trenches, effortlessly crushing anything unfortunate enough to cross their path. Though they are initially indifferent to your presence, provoking one will quickly reveal why so few explorers survive an encounter."
				""
				"Defeat this ancient predator and prove that you are capable of surviving the dangers that lurk beneath the waves."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/alex_caves_hullbreaker.png width:230 height:130 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"If you're having difficulty locating a Hullbreaker, don't worry."
				""
				"A Hullbreaker can almost always be found patrolling the entrance to the &9Sunken City&r, making it one of the most reliable locations to seek out the beast before continuing your progression through the Abyssal Chasm."
				""
				"Come prepared—the depths leave little room for mistakes."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Defeating the Hullbreaker rewards you with two valuable items that will aid your journey far beyond the Abyssal Chasm."
				""
				"The first is an &bEnigmatic Engine&r, an advanced piece of technology once used by the ancient explorers of this world. It can be repurposed later within the &6Conversion Crucible&r found in the &dCandy Cavity&r."
				""
				"The second is an &bImmortal Embryo&r, a mysterious relic infused with ancient life. Although it has little use for now, keep it safe—it becomes an essential ingredient later in your adventure when you reach the &6Primordial Caves&r."
				""
				"Every great expedition leaves behind relics of those who came before."
				""
				"Now, those relics are yours to claim."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "alexscaves:immortal_embryo"
				tag: { }
			}
