		{
			dependencies: ["1FE777D1CAD0CE01"]
			description: [
				"Towering above the &2Primordial Caves&r are immense &cVolcanoes&r, their peaks constantly erupting as rivers of molten rock carve through the ancient landscape."
				""
				"These volcanic giants are among the most dangerous locations on the planet, concealing rare resources deep within their fiery interiors. Only those willing to brave the intense heat and navigate their treacherous caverns will uncover the rewards hidden inside."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"While exploring the &2Primordial Caves&r, keep an eye out for the mysterious &6Cave Paintings&r scattered throughout the ancient caverns."
				""
				"Created by the prehistoric inhabitants of this forgotten world, these paintings depict dinosaurs, hunters, and scenes from a civilization long lost to time. Though they are not required for progression, they offer a fascinating glimpse into the history of the Primordial Caves and reward explorers who take the time to appreciate their surroundings."
				""
				"Sometimes, the greatest discoveries aren't hidden in treasure chests—but written upon the walls of history."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Deep within the heart of a volcano, you'll discover &6Primal Magma&r, an unstable material infused with the raw energy of the prehistoric world."
				""
				"This rare resource is essential for advanced engineering and is required to craft the &6Primal Magma Casing&r, a key component used in constructing the &cTier 6 Rocket&r and continuing your journey beyond the first Alex's Caves planets."
				""
				"Some treasures are buried beneath the earth."
				""
				"Others must be wrestled from the heart of a volcano."
			]
