		{
			dependencies: ["308B363D1029D44E"]
			description: [
				"The endless oceans of the &1Abyssal Chasm&r conceal the remnants of a once-great civilization now swallowed by the depths."
				""
				"At the heart of these waters lies the &9Sunken City&r, a forgotten metropolis ruled by &5The Leviathan&r—an ancient sea monster whose immense power has doomed countless adventurers. Though the Deeplings continue to worship their monstrous ruler, few who venture into the city ever return."
				""
				"Will you conquer the horrors of the deep and bring an end to the Leviathan's reign?"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/sunken_city_bg.png width:225 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Before you can challenge &5The Leviathan&r, you must first obtain a &3Coral Chunk&r."
				""
				"This valuable relic is carried by the fearsome &bCoralssus&r, a powerful guardian imprisoned within the Sunken City and protected by legions of hostile Deeplings. Defeat the Coralssus and claim the Coral Chunk, one of the key components required to summon the Leviathan."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/coralssus.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The ritual also requires an ancient weapon known as the &5Athame&r."
				""
				"Forged by the Deeplings and bestowed only upon their most revered warriors, the Athame can only be obtained by defeating the &5Deepling Warlock&r and &5Deepling Priest&r that patrol the city's sacred halls."
				""
				"Once both relics have been gathered, they can be reforged into the &5Abyssal Sacrifice&r, the offering needed to awaken the ruler of the Sunken City."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/deepling_warlock.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Before beginning the ritual, take time to prepare."
				""
				"Within the city's Altar Chamber you'll encounter &dAmethyst Crabs&r. These unusual creatures drop &dAmethyst Crab Meat&r, which can be blessed at the nearby &5Altar of Amethyst&r by simply right-clicking the altar while holding the meat."
				""
				"Consuming the resulting &5Blessed Amethyst Crab Meat&r grants the &5Blessing of Amethyst&r, completely protecting you from all three debuffs inflicted by the Leviathan during the battle."
				""
				"A well-prepared adventurer stands a far greater chance of surviving what comes next."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/blessed_crab_meat.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"With the &5Abyssal Sacrifice&r prepared, return to the center of the Sunken City and offer it upon the &5Altar of Abyss&r."
				""
				"The ritual will awaken &5The Leviathan&r, beginning one of the most difficult battles in the entire pack."
				""
				"The Leviathan commands crushing tentacle strikes, devastating laser attacks, and powerful abilities capable of leaving adventurers immobilized. Bringing &dEnder Pearls&r is highly recommended, allowing you to escape its grasp or quickly evade its deadliest attacks."
				""
				"Victory will reward you with the legendary &5Tidal Claws&r, a powerful weapon that also functions as a grappling hook, along with the rare &5Abyssal Egg&r—an essential component required to construct the &6Tier 6 Rocket&r."
				""
				"Only by defeating the ruler of the deep can your journey continue beyond the Abyss."
			]
			icon: "cataclysm:abyss_eye"
			id: "449BC30FBCC42249"
			rewards: [
