			dependencies: ["68C365750F63A231"]
			description: [
				"Hidden deep within a realm of charged stone and shifting magnetism, the &cNeodymrium Vent&r hums with potential. Its scarlet glow flickers with kinetic tension, offering a gateway to automating one of the most advanced resources in the known dimensions."
