		{
			dependencies: ["0B861C7DE0B810FB"]
			description: [
				"Dormant yet brimming with latent power, the &aUraniumnite Vent&r rests beneath the toxic bogs and irradiated swamps, hidden in plain sight. Its presence is marked by faint radiation and a slow, rhythmic pulsing that warns of the energy buried within."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/uraniumnite_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To begin, place &la blaze burner&r atop a dormant Uraniumnite Vent and feed it blaze cake. The resulting transformation will jolt the vent to life, converting it into an active node ready for automation."
				""
				"Once awakened, infuse the vent with &dacid&r, and begin harnessing its energy with &lMechanical Extruders&r to produce Uranium."
				""
				" &7Can you endure the rot, outwit the poison, and refine power from peril? The reactor is waiting.&r"
