		{
			dependencies: ["308B363D1029D44E"]
			description: [
				"The &1Abyssal Chasm&r is unlike any world you've explored before."
				""
				"Its endless oceans conceal forgotten civilizations, ancient ruins, and powerful creatures lurking far below the surface. Reaching these hidden wonders requires more than courage alone—you'll need the proper equipment to survive the crushing depths and navigate the vast underwater landscape."
				""
				"Before beginning your expedition, prepare yourself for life beneath the waves."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPreparing for the Dive&r"
				""
				"A complete &6Create Diving Suit&r is &ostrongly recommended&r before venturing into the Abyssal Chasm."
				""
				"Craft and equip the following pieces:"
				""
				"* &bNetherite Diving Helmet&r"
				"* &6Netherite Backtank&r"
				"* &bNetherite Diving Leggings&r"
				"* &bNetherite Diving Boots&r"
				""
				"When supplied with air from the Netherite Backtank, this equipment allows you to remain underwater for extended periods, making exploration of the planet's oceans significantly safer and more efficient."
				""
				"Water Breathing potions may help during short expeditions, but they are no substitute for a fully equipped diving suit."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"While the Diving Suit keeps you alive beneath the waves, a &3Submarine&r will become your greatest tool for exploring them."
				""
				"Scattered throughout the Abyssal Chasm are abandoned submarines left behind by earlier expeditions. These vessels occasionally appear on your &bMinimap&r, making them easier to locate as you explore."
				""
				"If you're fortunate enough to discover an &3Intact Submarine&r, simply free it from its resting place and begin your journey through the abyss."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/alex_caves_ruins_submarine.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Not every vessel has survived the passage of time."
				""
				"Some submarines have deteriorated into rusting wrecks resting upon the ocean floor. Fortunately, they can still be restored."
				""
				"Repair the damaged hull using &6Copper Ingots&r until the submarine becomes seaworthy once again. Once repaired, it functions just like an intact vessel, allowing you to safely travel across the immense oceans while searching for structures, resources, and hidden points of interest."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/alex_caves_destroyed_submarine.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Diving Suit and Submarine are not strictly required to progress, but together they transform the &1Abyssal Chasm&r from a hostile ocean into a world waiting to be explored."
				""
				"Many of the planet's most valuable locations—including the &9Sunken City&r, &bAbyssal Altars&r, and countless forgotten ruins—lie hundreds of blocks beneath the surface, where reliable underwater travel becomes essential."
				""
				"&lCaptain's Notes&r"
				""
				"• Use a moderate &eField of View&r while piloting the submarine."
				"• The &bSearchlight&r may not function correctly when using &aShaders&r."
				""
				"Prepare your equipment, chart your course, and descend into the depths."
				""
				"The ocean is vast..."
				""
				"...and its greatest secrets are still waiting to be discovered."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
