		{
			dependencies: ["172EE8617C59F90A"]
			description: [
				"&7With the first three &6Alex's Caves&r planets now explored, humanity's journey presses even deeper into worlds shaped by ancient power and forgotten civilizations.&r"
				""
				"The construction of the &cTier 6 Rocket&r represents the culmination of everything you've accomplished throughout the Abyssal Chasm, Primordial Caves, and Forlorn Hollows. Every prehistoric relic, abyssal artifact, and corrupted resource you've gathered now comes together to create a spacecraft capable of reaching even more extraordinary destinations."
				""
				"Your factory has evolved beyond an industrial complex."
				""
				"It has become a gateway to entirely new worlds."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lConstructing the Tier 6 Rocket&r"
				""
				"The Tier 6 Rocket is assembled using advanced components crafted from the unique resources of the first Alex's Caves planets. Many of its ingredients require powerful boss drops, rare materials, complex Create automation, and extensive processing chains spanning multiple dimensions."
				""
				"By now, your factory should be capable of producing sophisticated components through sequenced assembly, mechanical crafting, metallurgy, and advanced fluid processing."
				""
				"Need help crafting a specific rocket component?"
				""
				"Consult &6JEI&r for detailed recipes, ingredient requirements, and production chains for every part used in the Tier 6 Rocket."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Upon completing the Tier 6 Rocket, you will unlock access to the remaining &6Alex's Caves&r planets:"
				""
				"* &dCandy Cavity&r"
				"* &2Toxic Caves&r"
				"* &9Magnetic Caves&r"
				""
				"Each of these worlds introduces entirely new mechanics, powerful resources, dangerous creatures, and unique progression paths required to continue your journey toward constructing the &5Forge Rocket&r."
				""
				"New discoveries—and even greater dangers—await."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As your newest spacecraft lifts from the launch pad, you leave the prehistoric worlds behind and set your course toward the final frontiers of Alex's Caves."
				""
				"Every boss you've defeated, every factory you've expanded, and every resource you've automated has prepared you for this moment."
				""
				"The path toward the &5Forge Rocket&r is now within reach."
				""
				"The final expedition begins now."
			]
