		{
			dependencies: ["0273B1FC084BD73A"]
			description: [
				"&7With the &cTier 6 Rocket&r complete, your journey enters its final chapter as you prepare to explore the last three worlds of &6Alex's Caves&r.&r"
				""
				"Congratulations, explorer! You have unlocked access to &dCandy Cavity&r, &2Toxic Caves&r, and &9Magnetic Caves&r. These extraordinary planets introduce entirely new mechanics, advanced resources, and unique progression systems that will test every skill you've developed throughout your adventure."
				""
				"The road to the &5Forge Rocket&r begins here."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lCandy Cavity&r"
				""
				"Beneath layers of sugary terrain lies the whimsical yet surprisingly dangerous &dCandy Cavity&r."
				""
				"Within this colorful world you will discover:"
				""
				"* &oUnique food ingredients&r used in advanced cooking."
				"* &oGingerbread Men&r willing to trade valuable rewards."
				"* &oSweet-themed resources&r required for late-game progression."
				"* Rare crafting materials essential for the &6Culinary Life Support Matrix&r."
				""
				"Don't let its cheerful appearance fool you."
				""
				"Even the sweetest worlds hide dangerous secrets."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lToxic Caves&r"
				""
				"The &2Toxic Caves&r are a hazardous world where poisonous swamps, radioactive resources, and dangerous wildlife dominate the landscape."
				""
				"Those brave enough to enter will discover:"
				""
				"* &oRare chemical resources&r including Sulfur and other industrial materials."
				"* &oPowerful crafting ingredients&r for advanced engineering."
				"* Unique mechanics centered around &oPolymer&r, &oAcid&r, and protective equipment."
				"* Dangerous creatures guarding valuable progression materials."
				""
				"Preparation is the difference between survival and contamination."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lMagnetic Caves&r"
				""
				"Hidden beneath towering cliffs lies the &9Magnetic Caves&r, a world shaped by immense magnetic forces and rich mineral deposits."
				""
				"Here you will encounter:"
				""
				"* &oRare ores&r such as Galena and other specialized metals."
				"* &oAdvanced metallurgy&r required for powerful alloys."
				"* Unique geological formations unlike any previous planet."
				"* Resources essential for late-game automation and Forge Rocket construction."
				""
				"Every expedition into the Magnetic Caves brings you one step closer to mastering the most advanced engineering in the pack."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Candy Cavity, Toxic Caves, and Magnetic Caves represent the final worlds of your Alex's Caves expedition."
				""
				"Their resources will unlock the last major technologies, complete your Forge Rocket components, and prepare you for the ultimate objective of Create: Forge Frontier."
				""
				"The end of your journey is finally within sight."
				""
				"Now it's time to build the impossible."
			]
