		{
			dependencies: ["14077793D0743DF5"]
			description: [
				"The laws of nature behave differently within the &9Magnetic Caves&r."
				""
				"Towering crystals of &cScarlet&r and &bAzure Neodymium&r generate powerful magnetic fields capable of influencing players wearing iron or netherite equipment. Learning how these strange forces work is essential before venturing too deep into the caverns."
				""
				"What first appears to be an obstacle soon becomes one of your greatest tools."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Scarlet Neodymium attracts metallic equipment, allowing explorers wearing heavy armor to walk across walls and even ceilings. Azure Neodymium produces the opposite effect, repelling nearby metal and dramatically altering movement through the caves."
				""
				"Scattered throughout the biome are volatile &eTesla Bulbs&r, strange plants capable of releasing powerful bolts of lightning. Disturb them carelessly and they may explode, making the environment itself just as dangerous as the creatures that inhabit it."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Beneath these magnetic wonders lies &8Galena&r, the defining resource of the Magnetic Caves."
				""
				"Mine it in abundance and process it using your growing Create factory to unlock advanced alloys and powerful engineering materials. Many late-game crafting recipes—and several Forge Rocket components—begin with the resources gathered here."
				""
				"Sometimes the greatest challenge isn't defeating a monster."
				""
				"It's learning to master the world around you."
			]
