		{
			dependencies: ["14077793D0743DF5"]
			description: [
				"Although the Magnetic Caves appear quiet at first glance, countless strange creatures have adapted to life among the powerful magnetic fields."
				""
				"Metallic slimes roam the cavern floor while forgotten constructs continue carrying out duties assigned long ago. High above, mysterious machines silently observe every explorer who dares enter their domain."
				""
				"Even in abandonment, the caves remain well defended."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Defeat &6Ferrouslimes&r to obtain valuable Ferrouslime Balls used throughout advanced crafting. Beware the relentless &7Boundroids&r and their ceiling-dwelling &7Boundroid Winches&r, ancient constructs that protect the ruins with surprising strength. Keep an eye on the skies as well—the mysterious &9Notor&r patrols the caverns from above, waiting for careless explorers to let down their guard."
				""
				"Each creature provides valuable resources while preparing you for the greatest guardian that still awaits deeper within the caves."
				""
				"Every expedition begins with understanding those who already call this place home."
			]
