		{
			dependencies: ["14077793D0743DF5"]
			description: [
				"Hidden among the metallic landscape lies the &6Magnetron&r, an ancient construct created to defend the Magnetic Caves from intruders."
				""
				"At first glance it appears to be nothing more than a harmless &6Heart of Iron&r resting upon the cavern floor. Disturb it, however, and nearby metal is violently pulled together, assembling a towering guardian determined to eliminate any threat."
				""
				"Appearances can be deceiving."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Magnetron manipulates the very metal surrounding it, delivering crushing blows while using the cave's magnetic energy against its opponents. Bring powerful equipment and plenty of healing supplies before challenging this formidable guardian."
				""
				"Victory rewards the rare &6Heart of Iron&r, an advanced crafting component required for powerful Create machinery, late-game engineering, and several Forge Rocket components."
				""
				"Only those capable of mastering the Magnetic Caves may claim its greatest treasure."
			]
			icon: "alexscaves:heart_of_iron"
			id: "721783DE90F95E38"
			shape: "pentagon"
			tasks: [{
				entity: "alexscaves:magnetron"
