				value: 1L
			}]
			title: "The Magnetron"
			x: -14.5d
			y: 11.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["14077793D0743DF5"]
			description: [
				"The strange magnetic forces permeating the &9Magnetic Caves&r have inspired the creation of remarkable tools unlike anything found elsewhere in the Overworld."
				""
				"Forged from the unique materials harvested throughout these caverns, these inventions allow explorers to manipulate the environment, traverse impossible terrain, and uncover secrets hidden deep within the ancient mines."
				""
				"Mastering these tools is just as important as mastering the caves themselves."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"One of the most iconic inventions is the &6Galena Gauntlet&r."
				""
				"Powered by the magnetic properties of Galena and Neodymium, the gauntlet allows its wielder to interact with metallic objects from a distance, making exploration of the Magnetic Caves significantly easier. It can pull certain entities and blocks toward you, manipulate metallic objects, and help overcome many of the biome's environmental challenges."
				""
				"Experiment with the Galena Gauntlet as you explore—you may discover uses far beyond its intended purpose."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Not every invention found within the Magnetic Caves is built for mining."
				""
				"The remarkable &eSeeking Arrows&r harness the same magnetic principles to seek out nearby targets, making them invaluable for hunting fast-moving creatures or engaging enemies from a safe distance. When paired with a bow or crossbow, these arrows can dramatically improve your accuracy against elusive foes."
				""
				"For explorers who prefer a defensive approach, the &bResistor Shield&r provides excellent protection while utilizing the cave's unique magnetic technology. Its specialized design makes it an invaluable companion when facing the powerful creatures and hazards scattered throughout the Magnetic Caves."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Magnetic Caves contain several other unique tools and pieces of equipment designed around the biome's unusual magnetic properties."
				""
				"The greatest engineers don't simply conquer their environment—"
				""
				"They learn to work alongside it."
			]
