		{
			dependencies: ["1A2C4E8DD4FA3A3A"]
			description: [
				"The greatest danger within the Toxic Caves isn't always the wildlife."
				""
				"Radioactive minerals, corrosive chemicals, and hazardous gases have transformed the environment into a constant threat. Venturing too far without proper equipment can quickly turn a promising expedition into disaster."
				""
				"Preparation is your greatest weapon."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As you explore, gather the resources unique to this polluted world. Mine &eSulfur&r, harvest &aToxic Paste&r, and manufacture &bPolymer&r using your growing Create factory."
				""
				"One of the most important resources you'll need is &2Radon&r. It can be collected by filling a &fGlass Bottle&r at a &2Geothermal Vent&r, which can be found rising from the &2Acid Pools&r scattered throughout the Toxic Caves. Simply right-click the vent while holding a bottle to capture the radioactive gas."
				""
				"These materials combine to create the &aHazmat Suit&r, specialized protective equipment designed to shield you from the dangers of the Toxic Caves while allowing extended exploration of its hazardous environment."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"You'll also learn to produce &2Acid&r, an important industrial chemical used throughout advanced engineering and later Forge Rocket progression."
				""
				"Consult &6JEI&r whenever you need assistance crafting these materials or discovering additional recipes that make use of Toxic Caves resources."
				""
				"Master the environment first..."
				""
				"Then conquer everything living within it."
			]
