		{
			dependencies: ["1A2C4E8DD4FA3A3A"]
			description: [
				"Deep within the radioactive heart of the Toxic Caves lurks the twisted genius known only as the &5Brainiac&r."
				""
				"Once a brilliant scientist, this horrifying mutant has become the embodiment of unchecked experimentation. Surrounded by toxic chemicals and grotesque creations, the Brainiac continues its endless pursuit of knowledge without regard for the destruction left in its wake."
				""
				"Every failed experiment has led to this monster."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Prepare carefully before confronting the Brainiac."
				""
				"Bring your best armor, plentiful healing supplies, and equipment capable of withstanding the hazardous environment. Knowledge of the Toxic Caves' dangers—and a fully equipped Hazmat Suit—will greatly improve your chances of surviving the encounter."
				""
				"This is not a battle for the unprepared."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Defeating the Brainiac rewards valuable materials required for advanced crafting and the final stages of Forge Rocket progression."
				""
				"With another of Alex's Caves' greatest threats defeated, your journey draws ever closer to its ultimate destination."
				""
				"Some experiments should never have existed."
				""
				"It's time to bring this one to an end."
			]
