		{
			dependencies: ["6B1D694ADAF367E0"]
			description: [
				"Unlike every planet you've explored so far, nearly everything inside the Candy Cavity can be harvested."
				""
				"Candy blocks, chocolate, frosting, cookie dough, honey sprinkles, and colorful sweets naturally generate throughout the biome, creating an endless supply of ingredients for adventurous chefs and factory engineers alike."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Many of these resources are used to prepare powerful foods later in your adventure, including &dExtra Sugar Rush&r, &5Purple Soda&r, Chocolate Pie, and numerous other meals required for the &6Forge Rocket&r."
				""
				"As you continue exploring, harvest everything that looks edible—you'll likely need it sooner than you think."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Consult &6JEI&r whenever you're unsure what a particular ingredient is used for."
				""
				"The Candy Cavity contains more unique foods than any other planet, and experimenting with its resources is half the fun."
			]
