		{
			dependencies: ["6B1D694ADAF367E0"]
			description: [
				"Scattered throughout the rolling hills of the &dCandy Cavity&r are the charming &6Gingerbread Towns&r, peaceful settlements built entirely from sweets and inhabited by industrious &6Gingerbread Men&r."
				""
				"These delightful villages stand in stark contrast to the dangerous wilderness surrounding them. Their colorful homes, candy-crafted architecture, and bustling residents make them one of the safest places to rest while exploring the Candy Cavity."
				""
				"Don't rush past these settlements—they have far more to offer than meets the eye."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/gingerbread_town.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Each Gingerbread Town is home to a variety of &6Gingerbread Men&r, each with their own profession and unique trades."
				""
				"Spend some time meeting the townsfolk and browsing their offers. Many sell useful supplies, decorative blocks, food ingredients, and other valuable items that can simplify your adventure or support your growing factory."
				""
				"Trading regularly will not only reward you with useful resources, but also provide access to items that may be difficult to acquire elsewhere."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"At the center of every town resides the distinguished &6Gingerbread Mayor&r, the leader responsible for overseeing the settlement and its cheerful inhabitants."
				""
				"Take time to explore every building, interact with the villagers, and appreciate the incredible craftsmanship that has gone into these sugary communities. Hidden throughout the town you'll find valuable loot, unique decorations, and plenty of sweet treats worth collecting before continuing your journey."
				""
				"Sometimes exploration is about more than finding powerful artifacts."
				""
				"Sometimes it's about discovering the people who call these remarkable worlds home."
			]
			icon: "alexscaves:frosted_gingerbread_block"
			id: "7B4590618DE61BFE"
			shape: "pentagon"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "6350440022D69ED6"
