		{
			dependencies: ["6B1D694ADAF367E0"]
			description: [
				"The &dCandy Cavity&r may appear to be a land of endless sweets, but its sugary landscape is home to a surprising variety of creatures."
				""
				"Some peacefully roam the colorful hills in search of treats, while others fiercely defend their confectionery home from any explorer brave enough to enter. Understanding these unusual inhabitants is just as important as harvesting the biome's delicious resources."
				""
				"Even paradise has its predators."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Among the most recognizable residents is the majestic &dCandicorn&r, a magical creature that wanders the candy-coated plains."
				""
				"While normally peaceful, Candicorns will defend themselves if threatened. Their rare drops are used in several advanced crafting recipes and make every encounter worthwhile. Treat these beautiful creatures with respect—you may find yourself returning for their valuable resources later in your adventure."
				""
				"Not every treasure comes from a chest."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Beneath the colorful surface lurks the enormous &6Gum Worm&r."
				""
				"These colossal worms burrow through the soft candy terrain, occasionally bursting from beneath the ground to surprise unsuspecting explorers. Though intimidating in size, defeating a Gum Worm rewards valuable materials used in several late-game recipes and demonstrates your mastery of one of the Candy Cavity's most iconic inhabitants."
				""
				"Always watch where you step."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The sugary rivers and lakes are inhabited by the peculiar &bSweetish Fish&r, a colorful species perfectly adapted to life within the Candy Cavity."
				""
				"These unusual fish can be caught like their Overworld counterparts and are used in a variety of culinary recipes unique to this biome."
				""
				"Every ingredient has a purpose."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As you continue your exploration, defeat the creatures of the Candy Cavity and collect their unique drops."
				""
				"Whether you're preparing elaborate meals, crafting advanced components, or simply completing every challenge the biome has to offer, the wildlife of this sugary world plays an important role in your continued progression toward the &5Forge Rocket&r."
				""
				"Sometimes the sweetest worlds leave the strongest impressions."
			]
			icon: "alexscaves:candy_cane"
			id: "2137F38B93B8EAF0"
			shape: "pentagon"
			tasks: [
				{
					entity: "alexscaves:gum_worm"
