		{
			dependencies: ["6B1D694ADAF367E0"]
			description: [
				"Beneath the sugary hills and cheerful landscape of the &dCandy Cavity&r lurks a creature that embodies the darker side of this confectionery world."
				""
				"Known as the &5Lichowitch&r, this sinister sorcerer has mastered strange candy-infused magic, twisting the sweet resources surrounding it into dangerous weapons. Though the Candy Cavity may appear whimsical, the Lichowitch serves as a reminder that even the sweetest places can conceal terrible evil."
				""
				"If you hope to master every challenge this world has to offer, you'll need to seek out and defeat this powerful foe."
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Lichowitch can be found wandering the Candy Cavity, often surrounded by the sugary landscape it has corrupted through its dark magic."
				""
				"Unlike many of the creatures you've encountered throughout Alex's Caves, this foe relies on powerful ranged attacks and summoned magical projectiles rather than brute strength. Stay mobile during the fight, watch for incoming spells, and avoid allowing yourself to become cornered."
				""
				"Patience and careful positioning are often more valuable than overwhelming force."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Defeating the &5Lichowitch&r rewards several valuable magical ingredients used throughout Create: Forge Frontier, making repeated encounters worthwhile for ambitious explorers."
				""
				"Be sure to consult &6JEI&r to discover the many recipes that make use of its unique drops, as several late-game crafting chains rely upon materials obtained from this mysterious spellcaster."
				""
				"Even after your first victory, the Candy Cavity still holds many secrets waiting to be uncovered."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Lichowitch stands as one of the greatest challenges hidden within the &dCandy Cavity&r."
				""
				"Whether you're searching for powerful crafting materials, completing every Alex's Caves encounter, or simply proving yourself against one of the biome's strongest inhabitants, defeating this twisted sorcerer marks another major milestone on your journey toward constructing the &5Forge Rocket&r."
				""
				"Even in a world built from sweets..."
				""
				"The greatest dangers often wear the sweetest disguise."
			]
